{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id649234497"}, "name":{"label":"ageless learner"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-05-01T10:03:24-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.2.5"}, "id":{"label":"12607572849"}, "title":{"label":"Disappointed"}, "content":{"label":"Went for my daily walk today and came home and looked at my pedometer and it had closed off my app and got rid of all my badges in history over five years. A friend help me figure out how to reload it, but it has my badges or any of my past accomplishments. That isn’t all that important but it did encourage me.\nI’m very disappointed with your process and how you randomly just remove me from your program or your app. I am old, but I’m not stupid.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1166474262"}, "name":{"label":"fchjtrssfgliuyffvj"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-04-30T15:20:03-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.2.5"}, "id":{"label":"12604478504"}, "title":{"label":"Great for people with health issues"}, "content":{"label":"I very much appreciate the Apple health products. Apple’s activity tracking does a great job and seems to target mostly those looking for improved performance.  But people like me have slightly different needs, and I have found that pedometer plus plus gives me the exact concise information that I need to ensure I am doing what I am supposed to.  For my condition, both literature and my physician have recommended specific step goals rather than calories or whatever drives the Apple activity algorithm. \n\nSo for me, this app helps to ensure I am following the recommended guidance.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"3"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"7"}}, 
